export abstract anchor PitonFluency:
    pitonFluency:
        Before you do Piton work, run piton agent --print-fluency in the
        project and read all of the output. Do this one time in each
        context. If you already read it in this context, use that
        reading.

        The output is the correct reference for Piton syntax, project
        structure, commands and conventions. Do not invent syntax,
        commands or conventions. Use the compiler and its commands to
        find how Piton works. Do not make your own interpretation of it.
        If you cannot get the output, tell the user. Do not guess.
